                "text": "I value the health of working families. The bottom line is: Republicans would rather see tax breaks for billionaires than provide health care to those who need it most.\n\nI\u2019m working to get Congress back to work and prevent massive hikes in health care costs. https://t.co/X3n75bMUHE",
