                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As the government shutdown continues, I understand the challenges many federal workers are facing, missing paychecks and struggling to meet essential needs like housing, groceries, gas, utilities, and mental health support.\n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m hosting a virtual Government Shutdown Resource Fair to connect you with local partners providing food assistance, financial support, county resources, and more.\n\n\ud83d\udcc5 Wednesday, October 15\n\ud83d\udd54 5:00 PM PT\n\ud83d\udccd Live on YouTube: https://t.co/tlDsXia5TI",
