                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Republican shutdown is driving up health care costs, with families across our communities getting notices of major premium hikes. I'm fighting to reopen the government and extend Affordable Care Act tax credits to prevent your health care costs from skyrocketing even further.\n\nI want to hear your story. You can let me know by taking my official survey at https://t.co/6NVWvkB2Un",
