                "text": "Because of Speaker Johnson and Congressional Republicans, a 60-year-old couple from our communities would see their health care costs jump by $1,530 per month, or more than $18,000 a year, if they let the Affordable Care Act tax credits expire.\n\u00a0\nI\u2019m fighting to reopen the government, lower your costs, and prevent your health care expenses from skyrocketing even further.",
