                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Rural communities are getting hit hard by the already rising health care costs. That\u2019s why I joined my colleagues in calling on Speaker Johnson and Senate Leader Thune to extend the ACA enhanced premium tax credits to prevent skyrocketing costs further. \u00a0\n\u00a0\nWe must reopen the government, lower costs, and protect the health care rural communities depend on.",
