                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "WATCH: My Q&A with Brick Williams, who is being directly affected by the Republican government shutdown.\n\nPeople in our communities, like Brick, shouldn\u2019t have to choose between paying for lifesaving medicine or keeping a roof over their heads. It\u2019s time for Speaker Johnson to call Congress back to work, reopen the government, protect health care, and lower costs for working people.",
