                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Tomorrow, November 1, starts the #CoveredCalifornia annual open enrollment period.\u00a0Nearly 2 million Californians rely on the ACA tax credits to lower health care costs.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nThese tax credits make health coverage more affordable. Yet, Congressional Republicans have failed to extend them beyond this year. That\u2019s why I\u2019m continuing to fight for working people to reopen the government, protect health care, and lower costs.",
