                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Since day one of the shutdown, I\u2019ve been working to reopen the government, protect healthcare, and keep ACA tax credits in place so our communities aren\u2019t slammed with health care costs that could climb by up to $18,000 a year.\n\u00a0\nThat\u2019s also why I\u2019m standing with those feeling the impact the most. I recently hosted a virtual resource fair to connect people with immediate support, including help with groceries, rent and mortgage payments, and gas and utility bills.",
